    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">The company opened nine branches in Q1 2018, eight branches in Q2 , three branches in Q3, seven branches in Q4 bringing its total branches in Saudi Arabia to 215.</span></span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">The company opened four branches in Cairo and four in Giza, bringing its total branches in Egypt to 45 in Q4 2018.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
